  "dfp_known_from": {
    "rule": "At origin t, year-Y annual = latest vintage with published<=t that contains Y. Share path fires when every horizon calendar year has such an annual. Publication dates: DEF 2021≈15-Apr-2021; DEF 2024 CdM 9-Apr-2024; DFP 2025 CdM 9-Apr-2025; DFP 2026 CdM 22-Apr-2026.",
